{"title":"Yeti Fang","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Snow Yeti, Yeti, Graymaw</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"snow-yeti\" title=\"Snow Yeti - dropped it in 13 of 13 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/fbb7c3a210206114eb53.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snow Yeti</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"yeti-ravager\" title=\"Graymaw - dropped it in 5 of 6 looted corpses (1/1.2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/18aad708801ed6539ecc.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Graymaw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.2<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"yeti\" title=\"Yeti - dropped it in 12 of 15 looted corpses (1/1.3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/b760103e1fa0075def23.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Yeti</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–4</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"yeti-fang\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/b964f6987e786c9b807e.svg\" alt=\"Yeti Fang\"></div><h3>Yeti Fang</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <